{title: Owe No One Anything}
{subtitle: Romans 13:8}
{key: Eb}
{tempo: 79}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [Eb] | [Eb] | [Abmaj7] | [Cm7] |
| [Abmaj7] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Eb]Give [Bb/D]to whom taxes [Cm7]are due
[Abmaj7]Respect [Bb]and honor [Eb]in view
Submit for con[Bb/D]science sake [Cm7]
For the com[Abmaj7]mandments' sake
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Eb]Owe no one [Bb]anything
[Cm7]Except to love one [Abmaj7]another
[Eb]Whoever loves the oth[Bb]er
[Abmaj7]Has fulfilled the [Eb]law [Bb][Abmaj7]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Eb]Do not commit [Bb/D]adulte[Cm7]ry
[Abmaj7]Do [Bb]not steal or [Eb]murder
Do not [Bb/D]covet what is [Cm7]his
Love your neigh[Abmaj7]bor as your[Bb]self
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
Love does no [Bb]harm to a neigh[Cm7]bor
There[Abmaj7]fore love is [Bb]the law's [Cm7]end
Wake from [Abmaj7]sleep, [Bb]the hour [Cm7]is come
Sal[Abmaj7]vation is [Bbsus4]near now
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Eb]Owe no one [Bb]anything
[Cm]Except to love one [Ab]another
[Eb]Whoever loves the oth[Bb]er
[Ab]Has fulfilled the law
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
[Eb]Owe no one [Bb]anything
[Cm]Except to love one an[Ab]other
{end_of_verse}

